# ==============================================================================
# HUGGING FACE SPACE SECRETS CONFIGURATION (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# In Hugging Face Spaces, configure these as Space Secrets (Settings -> Secrets).
# To prevent automated scanners from flagging tokens, high-value credentials
# are stored locally as single plaintext variables (A, P, C, PASS) in .env and
# automatically XOR-encrypted before being uploaded to Hugging Face Spaces.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Tailscale Authentication Key (A)
# Generate an ephemeral, reusable auth key at https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys
# Example key: tskey-auth-k12345CNTRL-abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A="tskey-auth-k12345CNTRL-abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Playit.gg Secret Token (P)
# Secret agent credential token obtained from playit.gg dashboard
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
P="playit_secret_full_token_string_here"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Chisel WebSocket Tunnel Credentials (C)
# Format: <username>:<password>
# Default fallback if unset is user:apple123
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C="user:my_secure_chisel_password"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. SSH User Password (PASS)
# Custom password for SSH login (user@hostname -p 2222 or via Minecraft tunnel).
# If unset, orchestrator.py will dynamically generate a random 16-char password.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PASS="SuperSecureSSHPassword123!"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Hugging Face Hub Deployment Tokens (HF1, HF2, ...)
# Used by scripts/deploy.py to push built code to configured nodes.yaml targets.
# Generate Write/Create tokens at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# NOTE: Keys starting with "HF" are local and never uploaded to remote Spaces.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HF1="hf_YourPrimarySecretWriteTokenHere"
# HF2="hf_SecondaryAccountSecretWriteTokenHere"
